{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-36","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-36-talk-403813801-line","text":"无名客的列车停靠布达安尔利站台，后厢上有无穷馈赠。戴着毛毡帽的旅行者靠在车厢前，他衣着破烂，毛靴沾着泥土。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-36-talk-403813802-line","text":"你走近车厢，他朝你招手。「阿基维利曾化身普通人，与布达安尔利人一起开拓冒险，我们交换旅程中的有趣经历。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-36-text-2908554158114206784-choice","text":"组件交换。","speaker":""},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-36-text-13960570246390362169-choice","text":"组件覆写。","speaker":""}]}
